{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e03-scene-15",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "もう帰っていいですよ  (You Can Go Home Now)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "client_f": "女性客",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "A cheerful replacement actress arrives on location ready to perform, puzzled only by the kanji in her script. When Muranishi sees the other young woman crying in fear, he sends her straight home, fires the disrespectful hired film crew on the spot, and hands the camera, lights, and sound boom to his own loyal team. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よう、来たな！今日出演してくれる女優だ。はい、台本。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "何これ、焼き肉？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "振り仮名書いてといてやれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "この子のこと、だまして連れてきたんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もう帰っていいですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あなたたちも帰っていいですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺のエロビデオとお前らのクソ映画目の前にあったら、みんな俺のを手に取るんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君は残ってくれるんだね？はい、よろしく。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "奈緒子でーす。よろしくお願いします！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい、きれいにしてあげて。ラグビー、カメラ頼む。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "三田村、お前照明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "トシ、録音。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よう、来たな！今日出演してくれる女優だ。はい、台本。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, you made it! Here's the actress starring for us today—here's your script.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "何これ、焼き肉？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What does this say—is it a barbecue place?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "振り仮名書いてといてやれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Write pronunciation kana next to the kanji for her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "この子のこと、だまして連れてきたんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you trick this girl into coming here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もう帰っていいですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are free to go home now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あなたたちも帰っていいですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And the rest of you crew members can go home too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺のエロビデオとお前らのクソ映画目の前にあったら、みんな俺のを手に取るんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Put my video next to your lousy movie, and everyone will reach for mine!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君は残ってくれるんだね？はい、よろしく。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're staying with us, aren't you? Great, glad to have you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "奈緒子でーす。よろしくお願いします！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm Naoko! Nice to work with you all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい、きれいにしてあげて。ラグビー、カメラ頼む。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, help her look gorgeous. Rugby, I'm counting on you for camera.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "三田村、お前照明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mitamura, you're on lighting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "トシ、録音。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Toshi, you're on sound.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
